Subject: [PATCH] drm/stm: ltdc:  remove fixup callback from encoder to crtc
 helpers

[ 714992840543 not applied due to merge conflict ]

To avoid frequent calls to the clock framework, the fixup callback
can be removed. The processing of this function is handled by the
crtc_atomic_enable callback.

